    {
      "id": "7f774695-d864-412b-bf82-88f7e4a04457",
      "type": "flow:sticky_note",
      "typeVersion": "1.0",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "parameters": {
        "content": "This workflow adds an 'add/revoke \"monitor\" group membership' icon to the post menu for staff.\n\nThe \"monitor\" user group is used for monitoring accounts where there is suspicion of malicious intent, but not sufficient evidence to take action.\n\nThe added icon is used to add the user to the \"monitor\" group if not already a member, or to remove the user from the group. The action to be performed is communicated by the confirmation dialog.\n\nThe workflow locks the user to trust level 0 when added to the group, and unlocks the trust level when removed from the group.\n\nMonitor members' new and edited posts are hidden for review by W22b.\n\nAdapted for HHF from meta.discourse.org topic 414624 post 65.\n\n## Configuration\n\nCreate a User Group named `monitor`.\n\nCreate a Workflows Variable (the globally scoped Variable, not workflow-specific) named `monitor_group_id`. Set the value to the ID of the \"monitor` user group.\n\n---\n\nSPDX-License-Identifier: [CC0-1.0](https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/)",
        "width": 477.8506688807072,
        "height": 299.9998092184438,
        "color": "blue"
      },
      "credentials": {},
      "webhookId": null,
      "position": {
        "x": 419.4692350923133,
        "y": 90.53453376207895
      }
